      "image_url": "https://www.barbican.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/large/public/images/2026-07/Yuko%20Mohri%2C%20Decomposition%2C%202022.%20Fruits%2C%20wooden%20bowl%2C%20speakers%2C%20amplifier%2C%20computer%2C%20electrodes%2C%20cables.%20Installation%20view%20of%20Kanazawa%20Citizens%20Free%20Art%20Day%20Open%20Museum%202022%2C%2021st%20Century%20Museum%20of%20C.JPG.avif?itok=tFPw9i82",
